      ra: 9000000000486e50 ___bpf_prog_run+0x1370/0x36b0
     ERA: 9000000000485383 __bpf_prog_ret0_warn+0x13/0x20
  ...
   ESTAT: 00080000 [ADEF] (IS= ECode=8 EsubCode=0)

