+ * @MXL862XX_XPCS_NEG_NONE: no inband negotiation
+ * @MXL862XX_XPCS_NEG_INBAND_AN_OFF: inband selected but AN disabled
+ * @MXL862XX_XPCS_NEG_INBAND_AN_ON: inband with AN enabled
