Add DTS for the Vicharak Axon Mini board based on the Qualcomm
QCS6490 SoC.

This adds debug UART, eMMC, UFS, SDIO WLAN, USB 2.0 host, PCIe
support along with regulators.

Signed-off-by: Ajit Singh <blfizzyy@gmail.com>
